<blockquote class="uncited"><div>It appears that the CPS R2025.02.03.01 won't allow me to install the beta firmware on a DM-1701. It appears to only accept .bin files for the MD-9600.</div></blockquote>That's the "donor file" that is needed for DMR support.<br>The OpenGD77 part is delivered in OpenDM1701.zip <br><br>You should select the donor file first in the firmware loader and CPS will remember the location.<br>After that you specify the open firmware and the loading will start.<br><br>Donor software:<br><a href="https://www.passion-radio.com/index.php?controller=attachment&amp;id_attachment=760" class="postlink">https://www.passion-radio.com/index.php ... chment=760</a><br>(Use MD9600-CSV(2571V5)-V26.45.bin as donor for all radio types above)<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2867">SA0BUX</a> — Tue Feb 25, 2025 8:43 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
	</entry>
