<blockquote class="uncited"><div><ul><li> Add audio amp mute feature:    <ul>    <li> When the audio mute is enabled, the radio mode (FM/DMR) font is stroked.</li>    <li> Add "Mute: On/Off" in quick menus.</li>    <li> Use longpress '0' key for audio mute toggling.</li>    </ul></li><li> Some internal cleanups.</li></ul>The firmwares are available at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/HTQT39G8G4#xR0c3xPLGvUQ" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/HTQT39G8G4#xR0c3xPLGvUQ</a><br>The voice prompts are available at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/D3JKT50X7M#Md1OQqCWViCJ" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/D3JKT50X7M#Md1OQqCWViCJ</a><br><br><strong class="text-strong">NOTE</strong>: You <span style="text-decoration:underline">need</span> to use a CPS version greater or equal the the 2025/01/26. See the CPS section <a href="https://www.opengd77.com/viewforum.php?f=12" class="postlink">viewforum.php?f=12</a><br><br>For translators, the on-screen texts, voice prompts CSV are located at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/K6NBA7FRH0#owtc56LE34hj" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/K6NBA7FRH0#owtc56LE34hj</a></div></blockquote>Boa tarde, tenho um Baofeng DM1701 e atualizei e esta tudo funcionado bem, parabéns pelo trabalho.<br>Forte 73.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=7323">PU8YCC</a> — Tue Feb 25, 2025 8:37 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
